  "implementation": [
    "Capture the original document broker before posting video submitter construction, including the MediaStream factory.",
    "Register compositor sinks and bundles through that retained broker. Key thread-local bundles by immutable broker identity and frame-sink client ID.",
    "Preserve successor bundles when an old owner disconnects. Guard delayed GPU recovery and late responses after original-owner retirement.",
    "Carry the original broker through VSync initialization; process-static WebRTC dependencies retain their existing lifetime and are not generally admitted by this change.",
    "Repair stale test-helper declarations/definitions and install the supplied original broker in DummyPageHolder."
  ],
